-- AttuneNext static spawn counts (generated from TrinityCore TDB 3.3.5)
-- How many of each creature are spawned in its location; creatures not
-- listed spawn once. Used to turn a per-kill drop chance into a realistic
-- per-clear chance (Engine.SpawnCount).
--
-- Packed encoding: ONE sorted string of fixed-width hex records, 6 chars
-- each = 4 hex chars of creatureId + 2 hex chars of spawn count, counts
-- pre-capped at 60 (Engine SPAWN_CAP). Read with ANx.PackedFind(s, id, 2).
-- The old [id]=count hash cost ~230 KB on the 32-bit client for the same
-- 4904 records this ~29 KB string holds.
local _, ANx = ...
ANx = ANx or _G.AttuneNext

ANx.MobCountPacked =
